title: "Wetland Water Mapping with Random Forest"
abstract: "Google Earth Engine script that maps open water in lakes and wetlands from Landsat 5/7/8/9 with a Random Forest trained on eight spectral water indices, with hold-out accuracy assessment, variable importance and a multi-decade water-area time series."
